<concept id="t00322">
	<title>Controlling fan speed</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>automatic climate control system
					<indexterm>controlling fan speed</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02042">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e02043">
								<image href="images/N_SP3i26_C08_015_I.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul id="e02044">
			<li>
				<p>Use the fan speed control lever to set the desired fan speed.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>To change the fan speed, turn the button up to increase the fan speed or press it down to decrease the fan speed.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>To turn the fan speed control <term translate="no">OFF</term>, press down the fan speed control button several times or keep pressing it down.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
